---------------------------------------
Let's start with an existing dashboard instead of building every panel manually 

1.Open Dashboard
2.Select new -> Import
3.Enter dashboard ID 15757
4.Click Load
5.Select your existing Prometheus data source
6.Click Import

Dashboard ID 15757 is a community dashboard commonly associated with Kubernetes monitoring. Dashboard contents and compatibility can change, so if it does not load correctly, we'll choose a dashboard compatible with your installed metrics.

